            "textentryhtml":"<p>\n\tSeptember 16, 1996, the Merrin Gallery, New York, sold to the Princeton University Art Museum [1].\n</p>\n<p>\n\tNotes:\n\t<br />\n\t[1] According to receipt in the curatorial file.\n</p>",
